# npm pack output — the tarball belongs in spattoo-web/vendor/, never in this repo.
# `git add -A` after a release sweeps it up otherwise (it did, in 0.1.161).
*.tgz

# Claude Code scratch. `worktrees/` holds real git worktrees checked out INSIDE the repo,
# so an untracked directory appears the moment one exists — and `npm run release` refuses
# to build from a dirty tree, which is how this was found. `settings.local.json` is per
# machine by definition.
#
# Deliberately not the whole `.claude/` directory: a committed `.claude/settings.json` is
# how project-wide hooks and permissions get shared, and blanket-ignoring the folder would
# silently swallow it the day someone adds one.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json


# A reference cake photo for dev/edible-prints.html. A real one is a CUSTOMER'S, and a fixture is
# not a reason to commit one — drop any photo here to see the crop previews.
dev/photo.jpg
